  unitName: Holy Earth Lance
  unitId: 30015
  unitNumber: 340
  description: A pikeman from the ruined Principality of Vriksha, and one of the
    Six Heroes. He kept fighting for the masses with his Demon Pike Drevas. As he
    grew stronger and sharper, he started being consumed by Drevas. Despite there
    being a curse on the pike that assimilates its wielder with nature, Lance didn't
    refrain from fighting. He seemed to be anticipating the change instead.
  summonDesc: Well, let's go!<br>Drevas and I<br>will show you a bright future!
  fusionDesc: "Drevas, do you feel it?<br>My body is gradually changing\u2026"
  evoDesc: More Fusion, I see.<br>I've made a promise to Drevas<br>to become one
    with nature.
  element: 3
  rarity: 5
